    {
      "id": "ser",
      "title": "03 · 人称与 ser",
      "subtitle": "yo、tú 与身份介绍",
      "minutes": 10,
      "notes": [
        "yo = 我，tú = 你（非正式）。ser 表示身份、国籍等：yo soy，tú eres。西语常省略主语：Soy estudiante。",
        "问姓名：¿Cómo te llamas?；回答：Me llamo Ana。先把这两个表达当成常用句块，之后再学习反身动词。"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "type": "conjugation",
          "prompt": "yo ___ (ser)",
          "answer": "soy",
          "tags": [
            "ser-present"
          ],
          "explanation": "第一人称单数为 soy。"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "type": "conjugation",
          "prompt": "tú ___ (ser)",
          "answer": "eres",
          "tags": [
            "ser-present"
          ],
          "explanation": "第二人称单数为 eres。"
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "完成：___ estudiante.（我是学生，只填一个词）",
          "answer": "Soy",
          "tags": [
            "ser-present",
            "introductions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "哪句用于询问对方的姓名？",
          "options": [
            "¿Cómo te llamas?",
            "¿Qué tal?",
            "¿Y tú?"
          ],
          "answer": "¿Cómo te llamas?",
          "tags": [
            "introductions"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
